          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is Zinara jewellery safe to wear everyday?",
            "answer": "Yes. Our pieces are designed to be worn often, not saved for special occasions. They are waterproof, sweatproof and made with durability in mind, while proper care will help maintain their finish over time."
